        },
        {
          "text": "Abrahaamis, \"Akka ani boolla bishaanii kana qotadhe akka ragaa taʼuuf, gorommii hoolaa torban kanneen na harkaa fudhadhu\" jedhee deebise.",
          "type": "text",
